								"type": "wysiwyg_basic",
								"html": "<div style=\"color:#111111;\" class=\"rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-light text-dark\"><div class=\"btgrid\">\n\t<div class=\"row row-1\">\n\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/6b7ac85c-016d-43d1-b9ec-f7857d6b6326_DSC08568-2.jpeg\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\" class=\"d-block mx-auto img-fluid rounded\">\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\tThe Salvation Army Thrift Store offers gently used items, including clothing, bedding and other furniture, household goods, and much more! There is something for everyone, especially those on a fixed income or for anyone looking for great bargains!\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\tLocation: 100 Jefferson Hwy, Jefferson, LA 70121\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\tPhone: <a href=\"tel:504-835-7130\" target=\"\">504-835-7130</a>\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Store Hours:</strong>\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\tMonday – Tuesday &amp; Thursday–Saturday: 10:00 am–6:00 pm\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\tWednesday: 10:00 am–7:00 pm\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\tOur store supports the Adult Rehabilitation Center (arc), a center for men that provides spiritual, social, and emotional assistance for those who have lost the ability to cope with problems and provide for themselves. Our success relies on the generosity of donations to our thrift store. \n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div>",
